{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Lotus: Lost Memories</i> is a pixel art side-scrolling visual novel with a unique take on turn-based combat! Experience a fresh blend of strategy and action, with Quick Time Events that add a dynamic edge to each battle.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906620/extras/Story_Header.png?t=1748964559\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906620/extras/Story_GIF.gif?t=1748964559\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Step into the richly woven tale of Atsushi, a young samurai bound by duty to his ailing father. Navigate alliances, rivalries, and dark secrets from a hidden past that threaten to alter his path. Undertake a journey of loyalty, honor, and betrayal as he faces skilled adversaries and uncovers the echoes of a legacy that will shape his destiny.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906620/extras/Combat_Header.png?t=1748964559\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906620/extras/Combat_GIF.gif?t=1748964559\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Experience a fresh take on turn-based combat. Engage in calculated battles where timing and strategy are everything. Master QTE (Quick Time Events) to give yourself an edge in combat. Dodge, block, or unleash a ranged attack to turn the tide of battle.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906620/extras/World_Header.png?t=1748964559\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906620/extras/World_GIF.gif?t=1748964559\" /><strong>Encounter a cast of intriguing allies and enigmatic foes, each with their own motives and hidden agendas. As Atsushi build alliances and face betrayals, every interaction brings him closer to an inevitable showdown with a mysterious figure from his past, one whose intentions could alter your path forever.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2906620?t=1748964559","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906620/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1748964559","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906620/22ced04a0514d1e698c5377484edab77099a26a9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748964559","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906620/22ced04a0514d1e698c5377484edab77099a26a9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748964559","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"There is blood and a little bit of alcohol. Mostly in scenes of taverns and bars."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Lotus: Lost Memories</i> is a pixel art side-scrolling visual novel with a unique take on turn-based combat! Experience a fresh blend of strategy and action, with Quick Time Events that add a dynamic edge to each battle.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906620/extras/Story_Header.png?t=1748964559\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906620/extras/Story_GIF.gif?t=1748964559\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Step into the richly woven tale of Atsushi, a young samurai bound by duty to his ailing father. Navigate alliances, rivalries, and dark secrets from a hidden past that threaten to alter his path. Undertake a journey of loyalty, honor, and betrayal as he faces skilled adversaries and uncovers the echoes of a legacy that will shape his destiny.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906620/extras/Combat_Header.png?t=1748964559\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906620/extras/Combat_GIF.gif?t=1748964559\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Experience a fresh take on turn-based combat. Engage in calculated battles where timing and strategy are everything. Master QTE (Quick Time Events) to give yourself an edge in combat. Dodge, block, or unleash a ranged attack to turn the tide of battle.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906620/extras/World_Header.png?t=1748964559\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906620/extras/World_GIF.gif?t=1748964559\" /><strong>Encounter a cast of intriguing allies and enigmatic foes, each with their own motives and hidden agendas. As Atsushi build alliances and face betrayals, every interaction brings him closer to an inevitable showdown with a mysterious figure from his past, one whose intentions could alter your path forever.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Fenyx Digital"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906620/6cb6ded681906a66a17636a51124259245022110/header.jpg?t=1748964559","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id